*  l3_span_clean.sno - L-3 blast-radius probe (2026-08-12 s33).
*  SPAN: p=2 n=4. oracle [aabb]; defect-formula would give [bb]. MEASURED oracle = CLEAN CONTROL.
*  PREDICTION STATED BEFORE MEASURING - do not 'simplify' the subject:
*  a success-expecting or same-answer subject re-hides this row (FINDING-08-12 s3).
        S = 'q+aabbz'
        S ANY('+') SPAN('ab') . R 'z'            :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'R=[' R ']'                     :(D)
N       OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
D       OUTPUT = 'DONE'
END
